{"unit_id": "tag:08WF:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n先回顾几个范畴（category）论的基本概念，以简化论述。本小节固定一个背景范畴（category）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n对于两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>，回忆一下，所谓<TEXTITOPEN_0001>等化子（equalizer）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是对<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>而言的态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，它满足<MATH_0005>，且对于此性质具有普遍性（universal）。后一个陈述意味着，任意不带虚线箭头（arrow）的交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0006>都可以唯一地补全。在这种情形下，也称图（diagram）<MATH_0007>为等化子（equalizer）。将箭头（arrows）反向就得到<TEXTITOPEN_0002>余等化子（coequalizer）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的定义。见《范畴（Categories）》第<REF_0001>节和第<REF_0002>节。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n由于涉及泛性质（universal property），是等化子（equalizer）这一性质在应用协变（covariant）函子（functor）后通常并不保持（stable）。与单态射（monomorphisms）和满态射（epimorphisms）一样，在某些情形下可以通过给出分裂（splittings）来解决这个问题。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "普遍性"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "arrows", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "coequalizer", "target_term": "余等化子"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "covariant", "target_term": "协变"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "stable", "target_term": "保持"}, {"source_term": "monomorphisms", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "epimorphisms", "target_term": "满态射"}, {"source_term": "splittings", "target_term": "分裂"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "背景范畴和范畴论概念，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "取等化子的两个态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "等化子定义及保持性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "实现等化子的态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "普遍性", "context": "刻画等化子的普遍性，待决。"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "图中待补出的箭头，待决。"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "刻画泛性质的图，待决。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "等化子图，待决。"}, {"source_term": "arrows", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "对偶定义中反向的箭头，待决。"}, {"source_term": "coequalizer", "target_term": "余等化子", "context": "对偶概念，待决。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "等化子的性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "covariant", "target_term": "协变", "context": "函子的变性，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "用于变换图的函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "stable", "target_term": "保持", "context": "应用函子后的性质保持，待决。"}, {"source_term": "monomorphisms", "target_term": "单态射", "context": "类比的态射性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "epimorphisms", "target_term": "满态射", "context": "类比的态射性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "splittings", "target_term": "分裂", "context": "保证性质保持的分裂，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:08WH:statement", "translation": "<TEXTITOPEN_0001>分裂等化子（split equalizer）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是图（diagram）（<REF_0001>），它满足<MATH_0001>，且存在辅助态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "split equalizer", "target_term": "分裂等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "split equalizer", "target_term": "分裂等化子", "context": "定义的名称，待决。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "定义所要求的图，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给出分裂的辅助态射，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:08WF:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n关键在于，箭头（arrows）之间的等式（equalities）迫使（<REF_0001>）成为等化子（equalizer）：映射（map）<MATH_0001>通过<MATH_0002>唯一地分解（factors），写成<MATH_0003>即可。因此，对分裂（split）等化子（equalizer）应用协变（covariant）函子（functor），得到的仍是分裂（split）等化子（equalizer）；应用反变函子（contravariant functor）则得到<TEXTITOPEN_0001>分裂（split）余等化子（coequalizer）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，其定义是明了的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "arrows", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "equalities", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "covariant", "target_term": "协变"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂"}, {"source_term": "coequalizer", "target_term": "余等化子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "arrows", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "图中的箭头，待决。"}, {"source_term": "equalities", "target_term": "等式", "context": "分裂条件等式，待决。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "图的等化子性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "泛性质中的映射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解", "context": "通过等化子分解，待决。"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂", "context": "等化子和余等化子的分裂限定，待决。"}, {"source_term": "covariant", "target_term": "协变", "context": "函子的变性，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "应用于分裂图的函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子", "context": "反向图的函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "coequalizer", "target_term": "余等化子", "context": "对偶的分裂概念，待决。"}], "notes": []}
